WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.638
Let’s walk through Your role in the exercise.

00:00:02.638 --> 00:00:06.650
Use this opening step to establish ownership before learning controls

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:06.825
.

00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:09.588
Identify what this seat creates or reviews, what must

00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:12.550
be handed to another role, and which decisions remain

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.188
outside your authority.

00:00:14.188 --> 00:00:16.700
On this slide, as Red Team Scribe, you

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.712
turn deliberation into the durable Red Team record.

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:22.775
In practice, listen for intent, assumptions, and

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:23.750
trade-offs;

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.100
make them legible in Strategic Orientation and actions before the

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.488
handoff deadline.

00:00:28.985 --> 00:00:31.697
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:34.422
Draft and revise team-owned artifacts.

00:00:34.422 --> 00:00:37.885
Preserve rationale and required structured fields.

00:00:37.885 --> 00:00:40.072
Use the explicit handoff control;

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:42.610
visibility alone is not submission.
